Chapter: CvmmFileTable
  cites Cvmm chapter FileLive
  cites Cvmm chapter FileExplorer
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Booted with the minted FAT16 image fat16-list uses: its root holds the EFI
 directory and CODEX.CDX. The view lists exactly those; an empty listing is
 the control, and shows no row.

Section: Report

  ft-rows : List FileEntry, Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  ft-rows (es) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let e = list-at es i
    in ft-rows es (i + 1) n (acc & " [" & e.fe-path & " " & file-kind-label (e.fe-kind) & "]")

  ft-line : Text, ExplorerState -> Text
  ft-line (tag) (st) = tag & " " & st.ex-cwd & " entries " & show (st.ex-entry-count) & ft-rows (st.ex-entries) 0 (st.ex-entry-count) ""

Section: Entry
  opening : [Console, Device.Block] Nothing = act
    ex <- fe-live
    print-line-uni (ft-line "volume" ex)
    print-line-uni (ft-line "empty" (fe-from-listing [] []))
  end